  "title_zh": "从喀山、天津到新德里，习主席都提到中印最大“公约数”",
  "title_en": "From Kazan and Tianjin to New Delhi, Xi Jinping Highlights China-India's Biggest 'Common Denominator'",
  "summary_zh": "习近平指出，中方始终从战略高度和长远角度看待和发展中印关系，从喀山、天津到新德里，中印领导人连续三年双边会晤中，习主席均提到“发展”这一最大“公约数”。",
  "summary_en": "Xi Jinping said China views and develops China-India relations from a strategic and long-term perspective, stressing \"development\" as the biggest common denominator across three consecutive years of bilateral summits in Kazan, Tianjin and New Delhi.",
